# Old Wounds (sandoria 102): Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille, qm3 and Girtablulu in the Quicksand Caves. A WAR 75 with
# sword skill 240 (raw 2400) and the Sapara of Trials already held at 300 weapon skill points: a trade while available
# (nothing), the offer 43 (oncePerZone) taken with option 1 (the sapara held: none given; the Weapon Training Guide,
# begun); 46 with 1 (the sapara held), option 1 (nothing); the wrong trades (a bone chip; the sapara and a chip: not
# exactly); the sapara at 300 points (44: the sapara taken, the Map to the Annals of Truth); Curilla's 47; the qm3 pop of
# Girtablulu (SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE), qm3 while it is up (nil), the kill (killed_wsnm 1), the Annals of Truth, qm3 with
# the Annals (nil); 48 (completed: fame +20, the three key items deleted, Savage Blade, SAVAGE_BLADE_LEARNED); once
# completed her script's 530 and a trade (nothing).
# Curilla's script always starts an event (530 here: no Trust permit, Enveloped in Darkness not completed); the quest's
# Event-priority replies (43, 46, 47) alternate with it (interaction_lookup's UseFallback); 48 is a Progress event and
# always wins. Her script has no onTrade. A WAR 75 at fame 0 meets no other Curilla quest (The General's Secret needs
# fame level 2, Enveloped in Darkness an RDM). qm3 has no script; its default is NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. No Sandy
# mission is current. The other sides: #offer (the skill threshold, oncePerZone, the sapara given, a full bag, 45),
# #offer_job, #offer_guide, #abandon, #girtablulu_no_map.
lists ChateauDoraguille/Curilla/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/Curilla/onTrade ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/43 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/46 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/44 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/48 QuicksandCaves/qm3/onTrigger QuicksandCaves/Girtablulu/onMobDeath
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=29.2,0,1.1 job=WAR lvl=75
skill Sword 2400
item SaparaOfTrials wsp=300
item BoneChip
login
trade Curilla BoneChip x1                 # available: no trade handler (her script has none): nothing
trigger Curilla                           # can equip the sapara, sword 240, no guide: 43 (oncePerZone)
finish option=1                           # option 1, the sapara held: none given; the Weapon Training Guide, begun
trigger Curilla                           # the script's turn: 530
finish
trigger Curilla                           # accepted, no Annals, no map, the sapara held: 46 with 1
finish option=1                           # option 1, the sapara held: nothing
trade Curilla BoneChip x1                 # not the sapara: nil
trade Curilla SaparaOfTrials x1 BoneChip x1   # not exactly the sapara: nil
trade Curilla SaparaOfTrials x1           # 300 weapon skill points: 44
finish                                    # the sapara taken, the Map to the Annals of Truth
trigger Curilla                           # the script's turn (after 46): 530
finish
trigger Curilla                           # the map: 47 (Event)
finish
warp -144.9,1.9,448.1 QuicksandCaves
trigger qm3                               # the map, no Annals: Girtablulu popped and claimed, SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE
trigger qm3                               # Girtablulu up: popFromQM false, nil: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
kill GIRTABLULU                           # the map held: killed_wsnm 1
trigger qm3                               # killed_wsnm 1: back to 0, the key item Annals of Truth
trigger qm3                               # the Annals held, killed_wsnm 0: nil, NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 29.2,0,1.1 ChateauDoraguille
trigger Curilla                           # the Annals: 48
finish                                    # completed: fame +20; map, Annals and guide deleted; Savage Blade learned, SAVAGE_BLADE_LEARNED
trigger Curilla                           # completed: no section; her script's 530
finish
trade Curilla BoneChip x1                 # completed: no trade handler, nothing
